        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Compute canopy foliage and plant distribution functions. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes canopy foliage and plant distribution functions based on Massman et al. (2017) algorithms. Calculates foliage area fraction distribution throughout the canopy layers. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>MODLAYS</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of model layers </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>ZHC</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Height of each canopy model layer (z/h) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>ZCANMAX</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Height of maximum foliage area density (z/h) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>SIGMAU</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Standard deviation of shape function above zcanmax (z/h) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>SIGMA1</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Standard deviation of shape function below zcanmax (z/h) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>FAFRACZINT</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Foliage area fraction at each canopy model layer [output] </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="author"><para>P.C. Campbell </para>
