    <briefdescription>
<para>Routines for calculating canopy profiles and foliage distributions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This group contains subroutines for calculating canopy parameters, foliage area density distributions, and zero-plane displacement based on Massman et al. (2017) algorithms and vegetation characteristics. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
